  image("assets/client_batch.svg", width: 100%),
  caption: [
    Throughput of the client phases against batch size (higher is better).
    On the left is the `Query` phase, on a logarithmic scale (for Ring-LPN $t = 192$, for RAA $c = 3$).
    On the right is the `Decrypt` phase, which is TDM-agnostic.
  ],
